#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:6
#: d29157ba34fd4f69bc406cba7d83d195
msgid "Tuning for Autonomous Aerobatics"
msgstr "自主特技飞行调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:8
#: d67dcd29bca74bd29b67d401663075a9
msgid ""
"First, be sure your plane is capable of precision aerobatics. It must be "
"able to not only nose up hover in place, but accelerate vertically from a "
"hover, ie have unlimited vertical climb capability. It must also be capable "
"of sustained knife-edge flignt, ie have sufficient side area to fly knife-"
"edge."
msgstr ""
"首先，确保你的飞机能够进行精准特技飞行。它不仅必须能够机头向上悬停，还必须能够从悬停状态垂直加速，即具有无限垂直爬升能力。它还必须能够持续侧飞（刀刃飞行），即有足够的侧面积来飞行刀刃。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:10
#: 2a9111ea087c42ff80abd9166e0bcd7c
msgid ""
"Second, the normal ArduPilot Autotune provides a safe, stable PID tune for "
"most vehicles. As such, its not optimized for precision aerobatics which "
"require a tight tune."
msgstr ""
"其次，ArduPilot 的普通 AutoTune 为大多数飞行器提供安全、稳定的 PID 调参。因此，它并未针对需要紧密调参的精准特技飞行进行优化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:12
#: b333e6634c8a400d9dd2ea64f4f1977c
msgid "This article will discuss how to obtain a more optimized tune."
msgstr "本文将讨论如何获得更优化的调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:15
#: 4d93fce1590943d5b79a5fd37911e7b5
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:17
#: 2894d8b80bf64a00809c16c90650d7de
msgid ""
"Be sure the COG is properly setup. Nose heavy vehicles will perform poorly. "
"Tail heavy vehicles will involve significant repairs."
msgstr "确保重心设置正确。机头过重的飞行器性能会很差。机尾过重则会涉及大量维修。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:18
#: 1e94285063b34fc0a6be132862534544
msgid "Set :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` = 200"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` = 200"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:19
#: de259587b3a94c31b6a622149d9d10d6
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK<ONESHOT_MASK>` to match the servos controlling the "
"flying surfaces, assuming that they are digital servos capable of 200Hz "
"signaling"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK<ONESHOT_MASK>` 以匹配控制飞行面的舵机，假设它们是能够以 200Hz 信号频率工作的数字舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:20
#: 8529c81f663c426498235b85a8c843be
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` = 40Hz to increase phase margin."
" Be sure the motor/propeller is well balanced and control surface hinges "
"slop-free to minimize vibration since the filtering is being raised."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` = 40Hz "
"以增加相位裕度。确保电机/螺旋桨平衡良好且控制面铰链间隙最小，以减少震动，因为滤波器截止频率正在提高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:21
#: 030b3085e8624d9da888e54ee594a5ae
msgid ""
"Depending on the amount of fuselage side area, adequate knife-edge "
"performance may require setting the ``AEROM_KE_ANGLE`` plane_aerobatics.lua "
"parameter to 5-15 degrees to get adequate altitude hold on knife-edges, "
"rolling circles, etc."
msgstr ""
"根据机身侧面积的大小，充分的刀刃飞行性能可能需要将 ``AEROM_KE_ANGLE`` plane_aerobatics.lua 参数设置为 5-15"
" 度，以在刀刃飞行、滚转圆等动作中获得足够的高度保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:24
#: 271742a4278f4d719385d5130c7e3461
msgid "Verifying the Rate Capabilities"
msgstr "验证角速率能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:26
#: 7e53305e6eef4d759bce1bbb315fa4aa
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ACRO_PITCH_RATE<ACRO_PITCH_RATE>`, "
":ref:`ACRO_ROLL_RATE<ACRO_ROLL_RATE>`, and "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` must be set to less than what the "
"airframe is capable of doing. Values of 180, 360, and 90 degress per second,"
" respectively, are adequate for aerobatics, but they should be verified to "
"be less than the vehicles's maximum capabilities."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_PITCH_RATE<ACRO_PITCH_RATE>`、:ref:`ACRO_ROLL_RATE<ACRO_ROLL_RATE>`"
" 和 :ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` 必须设置为低于机架实际能达到的值。俯仰、横滚和偏航分别为 180、360 "
"和 90 度/秒的值对于特技飞行是足够的，但应验证这些值确实低于飞行器的最大能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:28
#: 0f369cc1aaed4fd6bd626def230a1ff9
msgid ""
"Do a flight in Manual mode, with full stick movements in all axes in order "
"to determine the maximum rotation rates that can be obtained. Analysis of "
"the flight logs using the IMU[0].GyrX for roll in radians/second, "
"IMU[0].GyrY for pitch, and IMU[0].GyrZ for yaw log messages will show the "
"obtained rates."
msgstr ""
"在手动模式下飞行，在所有轴向进行全杆量操作，以确定可以获得的最大旋转速率。分析飞行日志，使用 "
"IMU[0].GyrX（以弧度/秒为单位的横滚）、IMU[0].GyrY（俯仰）和 IMU[0].GyrZ（偏航）日志消息将显示获得的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:30
#: 71c466f4fc9640138b031d57e32dd8e4
msgid ""
"Below is a graph in MAVExplorer of those log messages (converted to "
"degrees/s) from a flight log of a vehicle in MANUAL doing full stick moves "
"to establish the maximum rate capabilities:"
msgstr ""
"下面是一张 MAVExplorer 中的图表，显示了一架飞行器在手动模式下进行全杆量操作以确定最大速率能力的飞行日志中这些日志消息（转换为度/秒）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:35
#: f70b7f23e0014022b9f00120319a3352
msgid ""
"The vehicle is definitely capable of meeting the 360 deg/s for roll, while "
"180 deg/s would be acceptable for pitch (it varies as its looping due to "
"varying airspeed, but 180 is the average), 90 deg/s for yaw is acceptable."
msgstr ""
"该飞行器的横滚速率明显能够达到 360 度/秒，而 180 度/秒对于俯仰来说是可以接受的（由于空速变化导致盘旋时有所变化，但 180 "
"是平均值），偏航的 90 度/秒是可以接受的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:37
#: 96dfaa3e372b4c98ad7f979961b8874a
msgid ""
"Note that Yaw rate checking should be done with short stick movements, "
"instead of prolonged full stick deflections to prevent excessive speed bleed"
" off while the vehicle is slipping hard into the airstream."
msgstr "请注意，偏航速率检查应使用短暂的杆量操作，而不是长时间全杆偏转，以防止飞行器大幅侧滑时速度过度损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:40
#: e8a486f9bbc443b09fc6a48ecbfafed1
msgid "AutoTune"
msgstr "AutoTune"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:42
#: 1a375df0af1e423c968e614031a73012
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`AUTOTUNE_LEVEL<AUTOTUNE_LEVEL>` = 8, and do an :ref:`Autotuning "
"<automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` flight. Be sure to have set "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` =1, and tune all three axes."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_LEVEL<AUTOTUNE_LEVEL>` = 8，并进行一次 :ref:`自动调参 <automatic-"
"tuning-with-autotune>` 飞行。确保已设置 :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` "
"=1，并对所有三个轴进行调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:44
#: 71e52e391d684fc09aae16bf49b7c882
msgid ""
"with yaw controller active, turns will require not only aileron but also "
"rudder in Autotune!"
msgstr "激活偏航控制器后，在 AutoTune 中转弯不仅需要副翼，还需要方向舵！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:47
#: 0766c5145cf8455d841f27a0c46624aa
msgid "Check PIDS"
msgstr "检查 PID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:49
#: fd302ea493ab48c7825001b9c6f6a33a
msgid ""
"From the the Autotuning flight, check the logs for proper FF PID, and to "
"tighten up the P and D terms. For the following we will look at an actual "
"log and check if how the Pitch portion of the Aututune turned out by "
"comparing the \"Target\" (PIDP.Tar log message) rates demanded by the stick "
"movements during the Autotune for pitch versus what the actual pitch "
"rotation rates (PIDP.Act) where measured by the IMU."
msgstr ""
"从 AutoTune 飞行中，检查日志以确认正确的 FF PID，并收紧 P 和 D 项。下面我们将查看实际日志并检查 AutoTune "
"的俯仰部分效果，通过比较 AutoTune 期间杆量操作所要求的「目标」（PIDP.Tar 日志消息）俯仰速率与 IMU "
"测量的实际俯仰旋转速率（PIDP.Act）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:54
#: 31eb215eaa3a4a1aa9bbe1a8c235ab84
msgid ""
"As the tune progressed adjusting FF throughout the tune, which begins by "
"optimizing D and then P, the matching became better and better, as expected."
msgstr "随着调参进行（首先优化 D 然后是 P），FF 在整个调参过程中持续调整，匹配效果越来越好，正如预期。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:57
#: c9a428ce8cc14675be0e6e4e0c57893b
msgid "FF"
msgstr "FF"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:59
#: ba68e3c3023f42fea35e651e6aa62cda
msgid ""
"This tune settled on a value of 0.285 for :ref:`PTCH_RATE_FF<PTCH_RATE_FF>`."
" We can check this by graphing the following using that value to verify its "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"此次调参将 :ref:`PTCH_RATE_FF<PTCH_RATE_FF>` 稳定在 0.285。我们可以通过用该值绘制以下图表来验证其准确性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:64
#: 0a342b8382a64397a21d1fc9dec4830d
msgid ""
"since the magnitudes of the two plots are very close, we know the FF term is"
" correct, in this case. If there is a disparity, you can adjust the FF value"
" in the first graph until a match is obtained. This is then the correct FF "
"value for that axis."
msgstr "由于两个曲线的幅度非常接近，我们知道 FF 项是正确的。如果存在差异，可以调整第一张图中的 FF 值直到匹配。这就是该轴的正确 FF 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:67
#: 594b447bdfce4daf9a2722bfa1f4e78e
msgid "P and D Tightening"
msgstr "P 和 D 的收紧"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:69
#: 649625fea41941f1bda3e468ede53213
msgid ""
"Typically, the FF will be very pretty accurate from an Autotune, but in "
"order to be safe for the majority of vehicles, the D and P values are tuned "
"until instability occurs and then reduced by 1/3 for a large safety margin. "
"This is illustrated in the log graphs below during the Autotune showing the "
"D and P values being adjusted until instability occurs (PIDP.Dmod < 1), and "
"then backed down by 1/3. While this is safe, its not optimum for response, "
"so increasing these values back by a factor of 1.5-2X will increase "
"responsiveness. Be prepared, however, to switch back to MANUAL if "
"instability occurs."
msgstr ""
"通常，FF 来自 AutoTune 的结果非常准确，但为了对大多数飞行器保持安全，D 和 P 值会被调整至出现不稳定，然后降低 1/3 "
"以保留较大的安全裕度。这在下面的 AutoTune 日志图表中有所体现，显示了 D 和 P 值被调整至出现不稳定（PIDP.Dmod < 1），然后降低"
" 1/3。虽然这是安全的，但对于响应性来说并不是最佳的，因此将这些值增加 1.5-2 倍可以提高响应性。但要做好准备，如果出现不稳定，切换回手动模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:74
#: 6df3a917a50e4dcdbc1fa12b0a5dd8da
msgid ""
"so in this example we would change the :ref:`PTCH_RATE_D<PTCH_RATE_D>` from "
"0.0016 to 0.0032 and the :ref:`PTCH_RATE_P<PTCH_RATE_P>` from 0.11 to 0.22 "
"and then test fly."
msgstr ""
"所以在这个例子中，我们将把 :ref:`PTCH_RATE_D<PTCH_RATE_D>` 从 0.0016 改为 0.0032，将 "
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_P<PTCH_RATE_P>` 从 0.11 改为 0.22，然后进行测试飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:77
#: cf244306e8944c8ab4d7b227e00e760e
msgid "Confirming Test Flight"
msgstr "确认测试飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:79
#: a3626bbf3942479e8f281c0a418c69d8
msgid "Do the above analysis for all axes."
msgstr "对所有轴进行上述分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:81
#: ba497e10b6c94d71821bef6d232e00b7
msgid ""
"After verifying and modifying the PIDS, fly again, being ready to resume "
"MANUAL control if unstable. A rolling circle trick is one of the most "
"difficult to execute with a softly tuned vehicle, so try that trick. If it "
"does not maintain altitude well, the pitch or yaw tuning during that "
"maneuver should be analyzed and tuning tweaks performed, assuming there is "
"not another issue like insufficient power or fuselage side surface area."
msgstr ""
"验证并修改 PID "
"后，再次飞行，准备好在出现不稳定时恢复手动控制。滚转圆是调参不够紧密的飞行器最难执行的技巧之一，所以尝试该技巧。如果它不能很好地保持高度，应分析该机动过程中的俯仰或偏航调参，并进行调参调整，前提是没有其他问题如功率不足或机身侧面面积不足。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerobatics-tuning.rst:84
#: b27a5608b3a04f11bdea27ed90bd8e8c
msgid "Video on Log Analysis"
msgstr "日志分析视频"
